---
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'');
import Documentation from '../layouts/Documentation.astro';
import ExampleIsland from '../ExampleIsland';
---
<Documentation title="Table collection"><main class="docs-catalogue"><h1>The complete table collection.</h1><p>TableCollection is the original DataView composition: the toolbar and its filters, sorts, properties, grouping and display controls share one context with the rows. Use Table only when you need the smaller rows-and-columns surface.</p><div class="docs-specimen"><ExampleIsland name="TableCollection" client:only="react"/></div><h2>Provider composition</h2><pre><code>{`SharedFiltersProvider (optional, controlled area scope)\n  ViewProvider (one state machine per view)\n    TableToolbar (filters, sort, properties, saved-view slot)\n    ViewLayout\n      TableBody (table / board / timeline, selection, pagination)`}</code></pre><h2>State and data adapters</h2><p>Pass ready-to-render rows in config.items. onStateChange receives the query snapshot. The application queries, then supplies the next rows. Column widths and order are presentation-only and do not re-query.</p><p>Pass state.initialState once, state.search after application debounce, and state.onPersist to store preferences. A different viewId should mount a new provider using key. SharedFiltersProvider is controlled by the area's URL/session adapter. Locks override stored values and cannot be cleared by users.</p><h2>Saved views, export and localization</h2><p>The savedViews slot renders inside the provider and can use useView() to read preferences and call applySavedView. The application owns its saved-view query and mutations. The actions slot hosts CSV export. TableLabelsProvider injects translated copy; TableRuntimeProvider injects navigation and date formatting.</p><h2>Forecast matrix</h2><p>Use ForecastMatrix for hierarchical period grids with controlled expansion, lazy child states and edit intents. ForecastMatrixFrame and ForecastExpandableRow support adapters that load child data per row.</p><a href={`${base}/components/ForecastMatrix/`}>Interactive forecast hierarchy and props</a><h2>Contracts</h2><nav class="docs-index"><a href={`${base}/components/TableCollection/`}>Complete organism props and executable recipe</a><a href={`${base}/reference/table/view-types/`}>Full nested configuration</a><a href={`${base}/reference/table/ViewContext/`}>View provider</a><a href={`${base}/reference/table/view-state/`}>State API and persistence adapter</a><a href={`${base}/reference/table/shared-filters/`}>Shared filter context</a><a href={`${base}/reference/table/TableToolbar/`}>Toolbar composition</a></nav></main></Documentation>
